  specifically, not "Real-time" (that label is reserved for ComEd/Ameren, IL) -- Dominion does not
  yet offer a true hourly DA/RT retail program, so current automation runs against its existing fixed
  TOU plan. Net framing: the automation technology layer is a solved, market-ready problem; the
